Description: RDKit 2026.09 C++ shared libraries for rdkit-rs
 Cheminformatics runtime with thread-safe substructure searching, fingerprints,
 descriptors, molecular standardization and InChI support. Libraries use a
 release-specific SONAME to coexist with Ubuntu's RDKit runtime.

